{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "26d3ef52-9671-8900-b7f1-74c7696120d4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-19T11:30:38-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Declan Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:27:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:27:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. Um, I am calling about a sidewalk. It is not cleared. Near the school."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a sidewalk near a school that hasn't been cleared. Do you know which school, or what street it's on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:27:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The, ah, the elementary school, on Girard. I think. The sidewalk in front, on the, the side with the fence. Nobody touched it. Not one time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:27:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is that from the snow we just had?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:28:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Is only a dusting, you know, not a big storm. But it is so cold, since the weekend, everything freezes. Now is like a skating, uh, a rink. And the children walk there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:28:18-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So it's a thin layer, but with this cold snap it's turned to ice. Do you have a number on the building, or a nearby house number so I can mark it right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:28:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the house across, is number 47. Four, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:28:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-seven, okay, I have that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:28:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, sorry. You say it back, I want to be sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:28:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got seventy-four. Seven, four, Girard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:28:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no. Forty-seven. Four first, then seven. Not the other way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:28:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry, I flipped it. Let me fix that. Forty-seven Girard, four then seven. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:29:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That is right. Good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. So the sidewalk in front of the school on Girard, near forty-seven, never got cleared and it's icy now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:29:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And, um, I would like to ask also. Can somebody put sand? Sand, or the salt. Because shoveling is not enough now. Is ice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:29:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for sand on that stretch. I can't tell you exactly when a crew will get there, they work through a list, but I'll note that it's by the school so it gets flagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:29:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Today, maybe? The children, they go home in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:29:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mark it as a school walkway and ask that it be looked at today. I can't promise the hour, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:29:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. I have my shop, I clear my own front every morning. Six o'clock. And the city, the school, nothing. It is, it is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Can I get a name and a number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:30:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Declan Quinn. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-five-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:30:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Declan Quinn, 401-555-0154. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, Mr. Quinn. I've got the school sidewalk on Girard near forty-seven, ice, sand requested. It's in now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:30:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I hope somebody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:30:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll send it over right now. You take care, and stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T11:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, bye."
    }
  ],
